Brand hardware purchase order and timeline
title end

paragraph start
Buy in the order the work needs it: the item that blocks the first task comes first. Record the date ordered, the date arrived and the date tested.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Do not order two items that do the same job before the first is tested.
paragraph end

